/*
  BatteryRangePanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0289 · BatteryRangePanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `BatteryRangePanel`
  resolves (table "BatteryRangePanel") lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the
  shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/vehicles/components/vehicle-detail/BatteryRangePanel.tsx). The second group backs the
  native-only chrome (loading / empty / error / retry / freshness) the Apple HIG states contract
  requires.
*/

